\v 1 This is the message¦315207 that¦315208 came¦315210 to¦315211 Yirmeyah¦315213 \add !(Jeremiah¦315213)\add* concerning all¦315216 the people¦315218 of Yehudah \add !(Judah)\add* in¦315220 the fourth¦315221 year of \add the reign of\add* Yehoyakim¦315222 (\add Jehoiakim,\add* son¦315223 of Yehudah's¦315219 King Yoshiyah¦315225 \add !(Josiah)\add*), which¦315208 was¦315229 the first¦315230 year of \add the reign of\add* the Babylonian King Nebuchadnezzar¦315231.
