\v 3 ⇔Yahweh's¦315274 messages¦315272 have¦315281 been coming¦315271 to me¦315275 for twenty-three¦315269 years since the thirteenth year¦315256 of the reign of Yehudah's¦315262 king¦315261 Yoshiyah¦315257 (\add Josiah,\add* Amon's¦315260 son¦315258), and I've¦315276 \add ≈passed them on\add* to you all \add ≈over and over again\add*, \add ≈but¦315263\add* you haven't \add ≈taken any notice\add* \add of them\add*.
\v 4 Yahweh¦315284 sent¦315283 all his¦315290 servants¦315290 the¦315291 prophets¦315291 to¦315302 you again and¦315283 again, but¦315283 you all haven't listened¦315295 \add ≈or paid any attention\add*.
\v 5 \add ≡Those prophets\add* said¦315304, ‘Let everyone¦315308 turn¦315305 from¦315309 their wicked¦315311 ways and their evil¦315310 activities, and return to the¦315316 land that¦315317 Yahweh¦315319 gave¦315318 in ancient times to your ancestors¦315321 and to all of¦315321 you as a permanent¦315327 \add inheritance\add*.
\v 6 \add ≈So¦315345\add* don't walk¦315331 after¦315332 other¦315334 gods¦315333 to worship¦315336 them or to bow¦315336 down¦315336 to them, and don't provoke¦315340 \add %him\add* with \add ≈things you make with\add* your¦315343 hands¦315343, and then¦315329 \add %he\add* won't¦315329 harm¦315345 you all.’
