\p
\v 8 So¦315364 Commander-in-chief Yahweh¦315367 says¦315366 this: Since all of you haven't listen¦315373 to my¦315376 messages¦315376,
\v 9 listen, I'm¦315378 about¦315379 to send¦315379 out a command to fetch¦315380 all the northern¦315386 peoples. Yahweh¦315389 declares that¦315401 I will bring¦315397 my servant¦315396, the Babylonian King¦315393 Nebuchadnezzar¦315392 and \add his armies\add* against this¦315401 land¦315400 and its¦315404 inhabitants¦315404, and against all the nations¦315408 around you. I will \add ≈mark\add* them for destruction¦315411 and turn them into a horror—\add ≈something to be hissed at\add*, and permanent¦315416 ruins¦315415.
\v 10 I'll¦315418 put an end to the sounds of gladness¦315423 and \add ≈celebration\add*, the sounds of \add #brides¦315425\add* and \add #grooms\add*, \add and\add* the sound¦315426 of the millstones and the light¦315430 of the lamp.\x + \xo 25:10: a \xt Jer 7:34; 16:9; \xo b \xt Rev 18:22-23.\x*
