\v 12 Then¦315450 after seventy¦315452 years have \add ≈passed\add*, then¦315450 I'll¦315454 punish the king¦315457 of Babylon¦315459 and that¦315463 nation¦315462—the land¦315472 of the Chaldeans¦315473—for their¦315469 wickedness, and make¦315474 it¦315475 into¦315476 a permanent¦315477 wasteland. That¦315474 is Yahweh's¦315466 declaration.
\v 13 Then¦315479 I'll¦315479 carry out all the messages¦315489 that I'd¦315492 spoken¦315492 against that land¦315483, and¦315479 everything¦315495 written¦315497 in¦315498 this¦315499 document that Yirmeyah¦315503 has prophesied¦315502 against all the nations¦315508.
\v 14 \add ≈Yes\add* many other nations and great¦315520 kings¦315519 will also make slaves out of those nations. I'll¦315521 repay¦315521 them for \add ≈everything they've done\add*.
\s1 The punishment of God of nations
