\p
\v 15 \add ≈Yes\add* Yisrael's¦315533 god¦315532 Yahweh¦315531 told me, “Take¦315535 this cup¦315538 of the wine¦315539 of fury from my¦315542 hand¦315542, and¦315543 all¦315547 the nations¦315549 that¦315550 I'm¦315551 sending¦315552 you¦315553 to¦315554, make¦315543 them¦315554 drink¦315543 it.
