\p And¦315739 after all of them, the Babylonian¦315750\f + \fr 25:26 \ft ‘Babylon’ here in the Hebrew is ‘Sheshak’, which is Hebrew for ‘Babylon’ with the letters substituted in a simple code.\f* king¦315749 will¦315751 drink¦315751 \add it too\add*.
