\v 29 because listen, I'm about to bring disaster to the city¦315796 that¦315797 is¦315798 called¦315798 by my¦315800 name¦315800, and¦315805 should you yourselves be free from¦315807 punishment¦315807? You won't¦315808 be free, because I'm calling¦315813 a \add ≈deadly army\add* against all¦315816 the inhabitants¦315818 of¦315818 the land¦315819.’
