\c 26
\s1 Wanting a death sentence for Yirmeyah
\rem /s1 Jeremiah's Prophecies in the Temple; Jeremiah Threatened With Death; Jeremiah Is Brought to Trial; Jeremiah's Escape from Death
\s4 Southern kingdom
\p
\v 1 \add ≈Near\add* the beginning¦315984 of the reign of Yehoyakim¦315986 \add !(Jehoiakim¦315986, Yoshiyah's¦315989\add*/Josiah's son¦315987), this¦315994 message¦315993 came¦315992 from¦315995 Yahweh¦315996:
\v 2 Yahweh¦316002 says this: Stand¦316003 in¦316004 the courtyard¦316004 of my \add ≈temple\add* and¦316008 speak¦316008 about all of Yehudah's¦316014 cities¦316013 who¦316015 come to worship¦316016 at my \add ≈residence\add*. Proclaim all the messages¦316031 that¦316024 I've commanded¦316025 you¦316008 to say to them—don't¦316028 hold¦316030 \add ≈anything\add* back¦316030.
\v 3 Maybe they'll¦316034 listen¦316034 and everyone¦316036 will¦316035 turn from¦316037 \add #their wicked ways\add*, and then I would turn back the¦316042 disaster that¦316043 I'm¦316044 planning¦316045 to \add ≈send\add* to them¦316047 because of their wicked \add ≈behaviour\add*,
\v 4 \add ≈so\add* you¦316052 \add need to\add* tell them¦316053 that Yahweh¦316056 says¦316055 this:
\m If¦316057 you don't¦316059 listen¦316060 to me¦316061 so as to \add ≈follow my¦316063 instructions that I've¦316065 given to\add* you all,
\v 5 \add ≡if you don't¦316080\add* listen¦316068 to the words¦316071 of my servants¦316072 the prophets¦316073 that I've¦316075 been¦316076 \add regularly\add* sending¦316076 to you, and \add indeed\add* you haven't listened¦316081,
\v 6 then¦316083 I'll \add ≈destroy\add* this house¦316086 like¦316088 \add I did at\add* Shiloh¦316088\x + \xo 26:6: \xt Josh 18:1; Psa 78:60; Jer 7:12-14.\x* and¦316083 I'll turn this city¦316091 into¦316095 a curse¦316095 to/for all¦316096 the nations¦316097 \add ≈in the world\add*.
\p
\v 7 The¦316102 priests¦316102, the prophets¦316103, and¦316104 all¦316104 the people¦316106 heard¦316101 Yirmeyah¦316109 proclaiming those words¦316113 at Yahweh's¦316116 \add ≈temple\add*.
\v 8 Then¦316118 as soon as Yirmeyah¦316121 had finished¦316120 saying everything that¦316126 Yahweh¦316129 had commanded¦316128 him to tell all the people, the priests¦316138 and the prophets¦316139 and all the people seized¦316136 him \add ≈and threatened to kill him, saying\add*:
\v 9 Why have¦316148 you¦316148 prophesied¦316148 in¦316149 Yahweh's name¦316149 and said¦316152 that this \add ≈temple\add* will be \add destroyed\add* like Shiloh¦316153, and that this city¦316157 will become desolate¦316159, with no \add #inhabitants¦316161\add*?” Then all¦316163 the¦316165 people¦316165 \add ≈gathered together\add* against Yirmeyah¦316168 at Yahweh's \add ≈residence\add*.
