\v 16 Then the officials¦316317 and all¦316318 the people¦316320 said¦316316 to the priests¦316323 and to the prophets¦316326, “This¦316330 man¦316329 \add ≈doesn't deserve to be sentenced¦316331 to\add* death¦316333, because¦316334 he's¦316338 spoken¦316338 to us¦316339 in the name¦316335 of our¦316337 god¦316337, Yahweh¦316336.”
