\v 33 They¦319996 turned¦319996 their backs to me¦319997 instead of their faces, even though I had \add ≈eagerly\add* taught¦320001 them. I tried to teach¦320004 them, but¦319996 they wouldn't listen¦320006 \add ≈or\add* receive¦320007 correction¦320008.
